, "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623370_2028304874429854_7431781529767267575_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Cbtnyk7XeJ8Q7kNvwHClMOt&_nc_oc=AdpJ6ZxUBuvTZl3H9msDJoH-_ZW9GtJ_c-_cGW780tHfBphx6_nAAQdYqsjf4YWcWiM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCAUS-fLzynTvYDdMJVbOWCp3sup0nnrnPuRsPIYD7I9A&oe=6A4CF204"}, {"file_name": "com.thetascape.glitterdark-20260518-194309-3 (0-00-00-00).png", "id": "2166514820749473", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620444_2166514824082806_7594381896913313778_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AtsLw5d9kvMQ7kNvwEf6QXq&_nc_oc=AdrQLd7ZJWrMn4sWa-WOx_ASkfUgy5t-SD02WPUGPzZ5PnZ3_Teov3QcBdORg0RvT8M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBkOagTGuqPGoJEp8rXHvBpYoPwizXFnCpfkdkT6TqcPQ&oe=6A4D01EE"}, {"file_name": "com.thetascape.glitterdark-20260516-181249 (0-00-00-00).png", "id": "1030246389532037", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595143057_1030246392865370_1866365755409781718_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=stfQJHy2fcIQ7kNvwGrneE1&_nc_oc=AdoCvht85pwDpwECNpZU53Ekb42ozDwYk02nEZF64yC6mpUGitnuRAVugPeU6dzi7Zs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBDSXiLnduPI37sQm2wYlhX_RTMBDyGCITItJUFv9OJeQ&oe=6A4D02B8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover_gd_ultimate.png", "id": "2154376705352631", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622285_2154376708685964_9142263970960497254_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2avbKE3nze0Q7kNvwFL43zM&_nc_oc=Adq8m-uv6Thsrmg5okKhN4qVcJ7AH1lHj4PJMuY71hB-eDPBm9lurvznf4jzsGswb5U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCPaPzjiqt3hCjaWR82HadCARlOCfYlUxMt9rzZ0WiFrQ&oe=6A4D1AA2"}, "display_name": "Glitter Dark", "keywords": ["musicvisualizer", "audioreactive", "handtracking", "radiostreaming", "meditation"], "long_description": "GlitterDark is an immersive audiovisual art experience for VR.\n\nEnter reactive digital worlds where sound transforms space itself. Every environment responds dynamically to rhythm, atmosphere, frequency, and motion, turning audio into a living visual dimension around you.\n\nGlitterDark is designed as a meditative and creative VR experience focused on immersion, mood, exploration, and audiovisual presence rather than traditional media playback.\n\nEach world has its own atmosphere and behavior. Some spaces react aggressively to beats and energy, while others create slow ambient transformations for relaxation, focus, or altered sensory experiences.\n\nThe app includes support for personal music libraries and internet radio streams, allowing users to bring their own audio into the environments. Music and radio act as sources that drive the visual worlds rather than functioning as the primary purpose of the application.\n\nGlitterDark is built for users seeking immersive art, atmospheric exploration, audiovisual meditation, sensory experiences, and creative VR environments.\n\nHands-only interaction:\nTap your left wrist with your right index finger to open the interface.\nTap your right wrist with your left index finger to close it. \n\nThis is not a traditional media player. GlitterDark is an interactive audiovisual VR space where sound becomes environment.", "short_description": "GlitterDark is an immersive audiovisual art experience for VR.\n\nEnter reactive digital worlds where sound transforms space itself. Every environment responds dynamically to rhythm, atmosphere, frequency, and motion, turning audio into a living visual dimension around you.\n\nGlitterDark is designed as a meditative and creative VR experience focused on immersion, mood, exploration, and audiovisual presence rather than traditional media playback.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.thetascape.com/glitterdark/pp.html", "developer_terms_of_servic